      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.68 (up from ₹0.28 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹511.1m (up 1.9% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹40.9m (up 145% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 8.0% (up from 3.3% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was primarily driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 25% per year but the company’s share price has fallen by 1% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings.",
